; Personal journal.  Entries are encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM.

name = "personal"
description = "Encrypted personal journal entry"
directory = "journal"
filename = "{date}-personal"
extension = "md"
encrypt = true
autofill = true
fields = ["mood", "energy=3", "gratitude"]

#day
##date
##time
##mood
##energy
--
## Highlights

{gratitude}

## What happened?

-

## How do I feel?

-
